# Frontend (`aif-front`)

Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before using unfamiliar Next APIs.

## Screens

- Investor: `/dashboard`, `/profile`, `/ledger`, `/holdings`, `/statements`
- Public: `/` (desktop home; below `lg` show login), `/login`, `/privacy`, `/terms`
- Admin: `/admin/*` via `AdminShell`. Client 360: `/admin/clients/[code]`
- API calls: `aif-front/config/endapi.js` + `apiFetch`. Token: sessionStorage + cookie `aif_session`.

## UI

- Page bg `#F4F7FB`. Cards: `rounded-2xl border border-[#E6EDF5] bg-white shadow-[0_8px_24px_rgba(20,50,90,0.05)]`.
- Fields: `rounded-xl border border-[#E3E8EF] ... focus:border-[#F97316]`. Selects need `pr-10!` (Tailwind v4).
- Labels `#1B3C6C`. Body `#16324F`. Muted `#7B8794`.
- Orange button: `rounded-full bg-[#F97316] hover:bg-[#EA6C0C]`. Outline: `rounded-full border border-[#D5DDE6]`.
- Sidebar tones live in `config/projectmanager.js` as `--pm-nav-*`. Use those for icons, not bright purple/green/rose.
- Icons: `react-icons/lu`. Prefer small tinted chips on white cards.
- Investor chrome: `DashboardShell` + `SideNav`. On mobile, account + Log out live in the side menu, not the top bar.

## PWA

- Manifest: `app/manifest.ts`. Home-screen icons: `public/icons/*` from `company.png`. Tab favicon stays `favicon_io (2)`.
- Installed PWAs keep old icons until the user removes and re-adds the app.
